\textsuperscript{26} See Proposed NI 93-102 at Section 29(3)(d) (proposing to require that the derivatives chief risk officer submit an annual report to the board of directors, or individuals acting in a similar capacity, of a registered derivatives firm).

\textsuperscript{27} See Proposed NI 93-102 at Section 27(3)(c) (proposing to require that the derivatives ultimate designated person report, on a timely basis, to the board of directors, or individuals acting in a similar capacity, of a registered derivatives firm).

